  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Every **DRUKHARI** unit has a Pain ability, tagged 'Pain', that works only while the unit is Empowered. With **DRUKHARI** as your Army Faction, you Empower your units by paying Pain tokens; some Enhancements, Stratagems and other rules also use them for extra effects.\n\nTokens you gain go into your Pain token pool, and tokens you spend leave it. You gain:\n\n- 1 as your Command phase starts\n- 1 per enemy unit **destroyed**\n- 1 per Battle-shock test an enemy unit fails\n\nEach Pain ability says when you may pay tokens to Empower its unit. The unit is then Empowered until the phase ends, and all its Pain abilities apply. While an Empowered unit is an **Attached unit**, every Leader and Bodyguard unit in it has its Pain abilities apply with no further tokens.",
